    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n19054" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βᾰθύ-ξῠλος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>with deep wood,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὕλης ἐν βαθυξύλῳ φόβῃ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					E.
					<u>Ba.</u>
					1138
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">β. δρυμοί</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arist.
					<u>Mu.</u>
					392b18
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>built high with wood,</i> [<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πυρά</span>] <i><span class="en">
				B.
				12.169
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense4"><b>b.</b>
			<i>deeply carued,</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γλυφαί,</span> of coffered ceilings, <i><span class="en">
				J.
				<u>AJ</u>
				15.11.5
			</span></i>.</div>
